            "block_content": "An employee who has completed at least three (3) months of continuous employment with the Company shall receive pay as outlined in the Program Design and the Non-Occupational Disability Guidelines. New hires will not be paid for the first twenty-four (24) hours of sick time during their first year of employment.",
